ons\n\n_(Test entries to be added by PlanPage tasks)_\n\n## Page: Search Results\n\n### Components\n- SearchSummaryBar\n- FilterSidebar\n- FlightResultCard\n- TrackPricesToggle\n- Pagination\n\n_(Test entries to be added by PlanPage tasks)_\n\n## Page: Flight Details / Booking\n\n### Components\n- FlightSummary\n- PriceBreakdown\n- PassengerForm\n- BookingAction\n\n_(Test entries to be added by PlanPage tasks)_\n\n## Page: My Trips\n\n### Components\n- TripsTabs\n- TripCard\n- TrackedRouteCard\n- CancelBookingModal\n\n_(Test entries to be added by PlanPage tasks)_\n\n## Page: Explore\n\n### Components\n- DestinationMap\n- FlexibleDatesGrid\n- DealsSection\n\n_(Test entries to be added by PlanPage tasks)_\n","numLines":56,"startLine":1,"totalLines":56}}}
